  "content_en": "第一章 初嫁王府“王妃，弄好了呢，看看满意不？”小喜放下手中的木梳，满意的端详着洛雪。 Luo Xue smoothed her bangs on her forehead and looked at herself reflected in the bronze mirror. Her black hair was like silk, draped softly behind her back. A white jade hairpin was inserted diagonally on her temples, which was not too high. It had just the right amount of white, swaying among the soft black hair, but it was eclipsed by Luo Xue's fair skin.出现在铜镜中的佳人，眉如柳枝，眸若繁星，对着镜子，若有似无的扬起一丝浅笑。 \"Are you satisfied?\" Xiao Xi asked proudly. Luo Xue nodded, \"You have made me so beautiful, what else am I dissatisfied with?\" \"Then Xiao Xi will help the princess change.\" After saying that, Xiao Xi picked up the dress lying on the beauty's bed and walked to Luo Xue with a smile. Luo Xue looked at it, and saw that the white and elegant dress had exquisite embroidery, and sparse or dense small flowers were seemingly arranged in an orderly manner on the skirt. On the waist and between the skirts, a few smart butterflies are flying and playing. Occasionally, a tired one or two will stop among the flowers, and the bright needles and dark lines outline one fresh life after another. \"Xiao happy, this dress?\" \"The prince specially went to marry Lan Ge to make it custom-made.\" \"The prince really has good intentions.\" Luo Xue passed by the hint of something in her words.嫁岚阁乃百年老店，除去御用贡品外，每年成衣不过十几件，件件皆是精品。 Everyone knows that marrying Lan Ge will make a man's fortune in a hundred days. This shows that Prince Yu has already made plans to marry Luo Xue. \"Wear a coat too.\" Xiao happy took a red gauze coat and put it on Luo Xue, which just reflected the festive atmosphere of a newlywed. “果然名不虚传，外衣的红色，纵使夺目却只是陪衬。”洛雪赞道，并点头示意小喜可以出发了。 In the water corridor of the small building, Luo Xue, dressed in red, shuttled through the purple gauze between the corridors and pavilions. Her thin figure was as dazzling as a butterfly. Xiao Xi was bewildered, and the bearers at the end of the verandah were also bewildered. It wasn't until Luo Xue called them that they came back to their senses. The servant bowed down embarrassedly, pulled up the sedan curtain respectfully, and said: \"Madam, get on the sedan.\" Luo Xuening looked at the gorgeous soft sedan in front of her and sat on it calmly. Xiao Xi stayed by the side of the sedan. After half a cup of tea, the sedan stopped. A servant opened the curtain, stood respectfully on one side, and said: \"Madam is here, please get off the sedan.\" Luo Xue slowly got off the sedan, looked up, and saw the three gold characters \"Pinjuxuan\" on the main door of the hall in front of her, shining on the red-bottomed gold-edged plaque.未来得及细细端详，就听见耳畔响起管家的声音：“七夫人到。”什么？ The seventh lady? Luo Xue was slightly doubtful, then adjusted slightly, and slowly walked into the somewhat serious hall with elegant steps. The first thing that catches the eye in the hall is a long carved sandalwood table, the carving is exquisite and lifelike. There are six hollow sandalwood round stools placed on both sides of the table. Going deeper, there is a low couch in the innermost part of the hall. On the short couch lies a square table also carved from sandalwood. On both sides of the table are Prince Yu and a graceful and luxurious woman. It is not difficult to guess that this is the current princess. Tables and chairs are also placed on both sides of the hall. Sitting on the relatively short couch and slightly stiff chairs were four beauties. They were of good looks, but they could not captivate the country. \"Sister, did you get up early?\" A shrill voice filled Luo Xue's ears.依声看去，左侧上座的蓝衣女子，略带怒色的看着洛雪。眉宇上的棱角分明，刺得洛雪格外的不安。洛雪暗忖：这样有棱有角的女子，倒像是外藩女子。 The tone of speaking with real swords and guns is so hot. \"Since she's already here, why bother making things difficult for the bride?\" Seeing that Luo Xue was silent, she must have been afraid of life, so the woman on the low couch hurriedly smoothed things over and came to a rescue.眼前妇人，微扬嘴角，不露齿的笑着看着洛雪。 Luo Xue half-crouched down and bowed: \"Sisters have been waiting for a long time. It's Luo Xue's fault. Please bear with me.\" She stood up, walked to Prince Yu, bowed and said, \"I would like to pay my respects to Prince Yu.\" She picked up the tea cup that the servant had been waiting for for a long time, bowed down and offered it with both hands, and said, \"Your Majesty, drink tea.\" He walked to the princess. , bowed and said: \"Luo Xue, please say hello to sister.\" After saying that, she picked up the tea cup and offered it with respectful hands, \"Sister, drink tea.\" When he was about to go to the woman in blue to offer tea, he was stopped by the prince: \"That's it, Luo Xue, from now on you and them will be on an equal footing.\" When he said it, he deliberately emphasized the word \"equal on equal footing\". Luo Xue felt a little happy in her heart.The woman in blue, who can sit in the area headed to the left, must have a higher status than the others. If he had really served her tea just now, would she have given him a slap on the spot? He raised his head to look at her, and saw that her anger was only increasing, and she was staring directly at the prince who was looking at him. \"From now on, we will all be equals. Your Majesty, I will introduce you to my sister.\" The princess stood up observantly, pulled Luo Xue to the woman in blue, and said, \"This is Zhu Ling, the second wife of the palace. She is an upright person. Cool, sister, don't be offended.\" Then he walked to the side and said with a smile: \"This is the fourth lady Lian Hua, the painter is as good as the painter in the palace.\" Then he pulled Luo Xue to the other side of the hall and said, \"Su Qi is the fifth lady of the palace.\" Then he pointed to the other lady. The woman beside her said: \"That is Yan Shu, the sixth lady of the palace. Okay, from now on we will treat each other as sisters. Your Majesty, have you introduced me thoroughly?\" Prince Yu nodded and acquiesced happily, \"Luo Xue, this is Ting Ning. Wang She is in charge of the backyard of the house. If you have anything to do in the future, you can tell her. \"Luo Xue thanked her and said, \"Luo Xue understands, please take care of me in the future.\" \"Breakfast!\" The housekeeper standing outside the door suddenly shouted. As soon as he finished speaking, more than a dozen maids filed in and placed the prepared breakfasts one by one on the long table. After the sisters were all seated, Luo Xue walked to the end of the table and was about to take a seat, but she was stopped by the prince: \"Sit on my right side.\" All the ladies turned their heads and looked at the prince intently. The prince pointed to the seat on the right, which had been empty for a year. Since she left, no one has been allowed to sit by the prince. The second lady, Zhu Ling, slammed the chopsticks on the table and shouted: \"Master, you have gone too far... I won't eat this meal!\" Then she left Pinjuxuan. As they passed each other, their eyes met for a moment, full of resentment, and Luo Xue could feel that she deliberately stayed for a moment, as if expecting the prince to stay, but there was nothing, so she had to leave angrily. After she left, Luo Xue heard Lian Hua's disdainful snort, a snort that was hard to detect. \"Ignore her, Luo Xue, come here.\" The prince greeted Luo Xue again. Luo Xue had no choice but to walk over and sit down next to the prince, opposite Princess Ting Ning. Such a position is undoubtedly announcing that her status in the palace is only lower than that of the princess. No wonder Zhu Ling left. But is this what Prince Yu said that you are the real princess in my heart? \"Have a meal.\" Prince Yu said, without much emotion in his words. Luo Xue lowered her head, picked up the bowl and chopsticks, and saw a pair of silver chopsticks picking up some green vegetables in her bowl. She raised her head and saw the prince looking at her tenderly, and hurriedly smiled back. \"Evil~\" A soft sound of retching came from the opposite side, which brought back the prince's heart that had just stopped here in Luo Xue. It turned out that it was Princess Ting Ning who had eaten something wrong and caused stomach cramps. \"Still can't eat?\" the prince asked with concern. \"My lord, this little one in my belly is really like you. It's only two months old and it's already causing me trouble sleeping and eating. How could it happen if it's older?\" As he said this, he looked at Luo Xue with a smile, his eyes mixed with other factors. \"It's always bad if you don't eat like this, right?\" Prince Yu asked with concern. \"I really can't eat it.\" Ting Ning seized the opportunity and said delicately. Prince Yu looked at her with pity, \"If you can't eat, you have to eat something.\" He cared about the child in her belly, his first heir and legitimate son. Even though he didn't love the person in front of him, the drunken sex incident still gave birth to his own flesh and blood. There is nothing wrong with the child, right? A picture of a couple's love in detail appeared before Luo Xue's eyes, and she watched every move. Princess Ting Ning indulged herself even more, begging the prince to feed her in person. The prince is already passionate, how could he refuse the beauty's request? Luo Xue, who couldn't eat anymore, put down her bowls and chopsticks, sat quietly, and secretly laughed at herself: Is this his promise? I'm afraid he has already promised to many people, right? How stupid I was to think that what he said was true. Luo Xue, the palace is not your destination after all, but you are already married, can you still look back? If you don't get married, how long can you cling to your childhood happiness? Suddenly I felt a touch of warmth on the back of my hand. \"Are you full?\" He whispered softly, a somewhat ethereal voice that seemed to have been carefully calculated to only fall into Luo Xue's ears. The speaker was Yan Shu. She smiled at Luo Xue, and her sickly makeup made her look a little more friendly. Luo Xue nodded and smiled. Such gentlenessWoman, it’s a shame to be plagued by illness. \"Ting Ning, you are feeling unwell, why don't you share some of it with Luo Xue.\" The prince's words interrupted the eye contact between Luo Xue and Yan Shu. \"Master, do you think I'm not doing well?\" Ting Ning asked confused. \"That's not the case, it's just that you are pregnant, and you may feel strange if you work too much.\" Prince Yu paused, \"In my opinion, it would not be bad for you to share some of the burden with Luo Xue.\" \"Now that Mr. Lao is concerned, I can still handle it, sister Luo Xue I've just entered the palace, I'm afraid I need to get used to it first, right?\" Luo Xue wanted to say something, but she couldn't get a word in at the moment. First, Zhu Ling resigned from the meal, and now the prince asked Ting Ning to share the household chores with him. I'm afraid her life in the future will be very difficult. \"Cough, cough...\" The coughing sound of Yanshu next to her reached Luo Xue's ears. Luo Xue patted her back with concern and asked: \"Sister, are you choking?\" \"It's okay, it's an old illness.\" Yanshu still coughed, \"Sister Luo Xue, don't worry.\" \"Yanshu, are you really okay?\" Princess Ting Ning also asked with concern. ... After a good breakfast, I stumbled over. It's natural that eating under the jealousy of a woman will taste like nothing, but Luo Xue doesn't understand where the third lady is...",
